{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["And they heard the voice of HaShem Elohim walking in the garden in the wind of the day — from his commentary to Exodus 14, it appears that he interprets 'walking' in accordance with Rav Halfai in Bereshit Rabbah 19:12, which is construed as referring to His voice."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {0 "Rashbam's own commentary on this verse is not extant; this note reconstructs his interpretation from evidence in his Exodus commentary and from Bereshit Rabbah, where the divine voice itself is said to be 'walking.'"}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:44:14.063219695Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}